commit 13a348b75eda800b9066b49949f93b1c142a001b
Author: fwyc0573 <935953068@qq.com>
Date:   Sat Oct 31 09:51:18 2026 +0000

    Add measured serving path ingress and handoff delays (B29, ingress option A)
    
    request_ingress_delay_ms delays the request arrival event while arrived_at
    keeps the client arrival, so TTFT and E2E still start at the client.
    request_handoff_delay_ms delays the KV transfer start after prefill for every
    connector. Both default to 0; explicit zero is byte-identical to the base for
    PDD and co-location. The A10 driver sets the measured P2-64 values (10.3 and
    11.4 ms), adds --without-ingress for the B28 configuration and --field for
    diagnostic variants, and records the CC backend type in the receipt.

