Author: fwyc0573 <935953068@qq.com>
Date:   Sat Nov 7 08:29:03 2026 +0000

    Fail native P/D waits when a peer heartbeat stops
    
    Generation07 of the P2-64 formal run lost one replica after the rendezvous;
    its peers waited the full 1800 s startup timeout. Each node now writes a
    heartbeat before ready.json and refreshes it from a background thread.
    Every wait fails once an undrained peer's heartbeat is unchanged for longer
    than peer_heartbeat_timeout_s, measured on the local monotonic clock.

